abstract: >-
  QNC - like its classical counterpart (Linear Network
  Coding) - gives answer to a network's scaling problem. It
  is modelled in a Quantum Repeater Network environment. You
  can use this instead of entanglement swapping in a
  butterfly network-like telecommunication system.
